license: MIT
abstract: "LLM Fine-tuning and Serving is a local machine-learning workbench for adapting and evaluating a language model on banking-support intent classification. It uses MLX-LM and applies a conservative policy layer to produce advisory ticket defaults."
keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - large-language-models
  - mlx
  - fine-tuning
  - intent-classification
  - model-serving
